				<description>&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA; &lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;profile-picture.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;me&#34;  /&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[&lt;code&gt;brianchen.chen (at) alumni.utoronto.ca&lt;/code&gt;] / [&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/ihasdapie&#34;&gt;github&lt;/a&gt;] / [&lt;a href=&#34;https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;amp;user=1fvqKyoAAAAJ&#34;&gt;google scholar&lt;/a&gt;] / [&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/brianchen28914/&#34;&gt;linkedin&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Right now I&amp;rsquo;m trying to teach autopilot to FSD good @ &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.tesla.com/ai&#34;&gt;Tesla AI&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Converted &lt;a href=&#34;https://newhokingon.com/rice-noodles-with-beef-and-vegetables/&#34;&gt;new ho king #N12&lt;/a&gt; to an &lt;a href=&#34;https://engsci.utoronto.ca/&#34;&gt;Engineering Science&lt;/a&gt; degree at the University of Toronto&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Upside-down reinforcement learning @ &lt;a href=&#34;https://tisl.cs.utoronto.ca/&#34;&gt;TISL&lt;/a&gt;, co-supervised by NVIDIA research&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Infra @ &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.uber.com/en-US/blog/engineering/&#34;&gt;Uber&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.ros.org/&#34;&gt;ROS&lt;/a&gt; for the NASA &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nasa.gov/viper&#34;&gt;VIPER&lt;/a&gt; lunar rover @ &lt;a href=&#34;https://openrobotics.org/&#34;&gt;Open Robotics&lt;/a&gt; (now Alphabet)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Memristor&#34;&gt;Memristor&lt;/a&gt; ML Acceleration @ &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.eecg.utoronto.ca/~roman/&#34;&gt;ISML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Autonomous vehicles @ &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.autodrive.utoronto.ca/&#34;&gt;aUToronto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Being the first engineer at a startup @ &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.kortex.co/&#34;&gt;kortex&lt;/a&gt; (now &lt;a href=&#34;https://eden.